{
  "id": 276285639,
  "iid": 14102,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "change display order of IEEE802154 address fields",
  "description": "This patch changes the display order of the IEEE 802.15.4 address fields\nonly for the IEEE 802.15.4 tree root. The order of the address fields\nfor the other trees is not changed. The order is now source address\nfirst. This is not the same as the order in the frame, where the\ndestination address is first. However, reading it from left to right\nmakes more sense when the source address is first.\n\nBefore this patch it was:\n![image](/uploads/947d2bf1bcbec2a29c985b7979409455/image.png)\n\nWith this patch it is:\n![image](/uploads/6a57db47f0740c0672274b6c36ca981e/image.png)\n\nBoth source addresses for the IEEE 802.15.4 and IPv6 headers are now on the left, which is easier to read IMHO.",
  "state": "merged",
